# The service account and its groups (sysusers.d(5)): the RPM installs this as
# /usr/lib/sysusers.d/agensio.conf, which provides user(agensio) and group(agensio) to rpm on
# Fedora; the .deb makes them in its postinst. agensio-admin: the control socket's admins.
g agensio -
g agensio-admin -
u agensio - "agensio web server" /var/lib/agensio /sbin/nologin
